# PR 1: Global Settings Tier + Gates — Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (if subagents available) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Add a user-global settings tier (`~/.config/entire/settings.json`) with exclude lists, and teach the two hook gates to consult it when a repo has no repo-level setup — so hooks proceed in un-enabled repos once global mode is on.

**Architecture:** New `global.go` in the existing `settings` package loads the user-level file via `userdirs.Config()` and exposes `IsActiveForRepo(ctx)` = `IsSetUpAndEnabled(ctx) || (!IsSetUpAny(ctx) && GlobalModeActive(ctx))`. The two silent gates (`hook_registry.go`, `hooks_git_cmd.go`) swap `IsSetUpAndEnabled` for `IsActiveForRepo`. Explicit repo-level setup always wins (veto preserved). Exclude matching: `exclude_paths` are `~`-expanded doublestar globs vs the worktree root; `exclude_origins` are doublestar globs vs the origin URL normalized to `host/owner/repo`.

**Tech Stack:** Go 1.26, `github.com/bmatcuk/doublestar/v4` (new dep, zero transitive deps), existing `userdirs` + `gitremote` packages.

**Working directory:** `/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-enable-cross-repo` (branch `feat/global-enable-cross-repo`; for the PR itself, branch `feat/global-settings-tier` off fresh `main` at execution time).

**Dark-launch note (intentional):** After this PR, a hand-written global settings file makes hooks proceed in un-enabled repos, and downstream capture will write `.entire/` worktree files there (PR 2 makes that invisible; PR 3 adds the user-facing opt-in). No user-facing command creates the file yet, so this ships dark. Do not "fix" this in PR 1.

**Commit discipline:** Exactly 2 commits (project preference: few logical commits per PR, not one per TDD step). Run tests after every step; commit only at the two marked points.

---

## Chunk 1: All tasks (single chunk, one new file + two gate edits)

### Task 0: Branch + dependency

**Files:** `go.mod`, `go.sum`

- [ ] **Step 0.1:** From the worktree root, confirm clean state and add the dep:

